==Danish==

===Etymology 1===
From {{der|da|non|svá}}, from {{der|da|gem-pro|*swa}}, {{m|gem-pro|*swē}}, cognate with {{cog|en|so}}, {{cog|de|so}}, {{cog|nl|zo}}.

====Pronunciation====
* {{IPA|da|/ˈsɔ/|[ˈsʌ]}}, {{q|with verbs and nouns also}} {{IPA|da|/ˈsɔːˀ/|[ˈsɔˀ]}}.

====Adverb====
{{da-adv}}

# [[so]] {{q|with adjectives, to the extent (that), often with a following {{glossary|dependent clause|dependent}} result clause introduced with the conjunction {{l|da|at}}}}
# [[as]] {{q|with adjectives, introducing a comparison, the second member is introduced with the conjunction {{l|da|som}}}}
