|passage=Men Hunden, som sidder paa Pengekisten, har her to Øine, hvert '''saa''' stort som Rundetaarn.
|translation=But the dog that sits on the money chest has two eyes, each '''as''' big as {{w|Rundetaarn}}.}}
# {{lb|da|dated}} [[so]], [[like that]] {{q|with verbs}}
#* {{quote-book|da|year=1876|author=Holger Drachmann|title=En overkomplet|page=172|url=https://books.google.dk/books?id=h2-8F-Y1Yy4C&pg=PA172
|passage=Men det var nok ikke saa.
|translation=But it probably wasn't like that.}}
#* Children's song, unknown origin
#*: Han sagde '''så''' og spurgte '''så''': | "Og hvor har du så hjemme?"
#*:: He said '''so''' and asked '''so''': "So, where are you from?"
#: {{synonyms|da|således|sådan}}
# [[then]], [[next]] {{q|adverb of time, temporal sequence}}
#: {{synonyms|da|derefter|derpå|herefter|herpå}}
# [[then]], [[consequently]] {{q|adverb of causal sequence}}
#: {{synonyms|da|af den grund|altså|derfor|følgelig|således}}

